#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""rice [solstice|plain] — switch the desktop look. Run without arguments to see the current one.

solstice  started from Kuehnelt/solstice-dots: Catppuccin Mocha Red, Amethyst Haze, monochrome
          icons, Karla, frosted-acrylic blur, rounded outlined windows, a floating top bar of
          glass islands (workspaces · clock · music + tray) over a full wallpaper, rofi on Meta,
          frosted alacritty, the solstice prompt and fastfetch.
          Krohnkite, alacritty, zsh, nvim and every keybinding stay as they are.
plain     puts back the KDE files saved the last time solstice was switched on, so any
          KDE setting changed while solstice was active is reverted too.
"""

